## Ignore Fabric Items
/**/*.Lakehouse/*

## Tabular Editor (auto-downloaded by UDF test runner)
TabularEditor.exe
TabularEditor.exe.config
TabularEditor-license.rtf
license-ELA*.txt
license-FastWildcardMatching.txt
license-TabularEditor.txt
license-TreeViewAdv.txt

## AskADIA shared scaffold — codegen artifacts copied into per-model definition/tables/
## by .deploy/workspace/askadia/deploy/merge_shared_scaffold.py --in-place. Source of truth
## lives in .deploy/workspace/askadia/udf/common/tables/. Each per-model copy is created
## fresh by merge_shared_scaffold (placeholder partition), then the partition body is
## overwritten in-place by the matching csx script during deploy preprocess. Per-model
## functions.tmdl is also mutated by --in-place merge + csx — use `git restore` after
## local preprocess runs.
/workspace/**/definition/tables/_COPILOT_MEASURE_COLUMNS.tmdl
/workspace/**/definition/tables/_COPILOT_QUESTIONS.tmdl
/workspace/**/definition/tables/_INFO_ANNOTATIONS.tmdl
/workspace/**/definition/tables/_INFO_COLUMNS.tmdl
/workspace/**/definition/tables/_INFO_HIERARCHIES.tmdl
/workspace/**/definition/tables/_INFO_MEASURES.tmdl
/workspace/**/definition/tables/_INFO_RELATIONSHIPS.tmdl

## AskADIA — Copilot/schema.json is regenerated from model annotations by
## .deploy/workspace/operations/generate_copilot_schema.py at deploy. Source of truth
## is the model's Copilot_* annotations, not the json on disk.
/workspace/**/Copilot/schema.json

## AskADIA — _COPILOT_INSTRUCTIONS.tmdl (table) and Copilot/Instructions/instructions.md
## (always-on router) are generated from .deploy/workspace/askadia/instructions/ and
## injected by generate_copilot_instructions.py at deploy. Source of truth is that
## store, not the files on disk; a local debug-deploy regenerates them.
/workspace/**/definition/tables/_COPILOT_INSTRUCTIONS.tmdl
/workspace/**/Copilot/Instructions/instructions.md

